-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"א/9: תגמול עובדי הוראה בגין הישגי בית הספר לשנת
-- הלימודים תשפ"א
-- The one-time grant to upper-secondary teaching employees for their
-- school's achievements in school year תשפ"א (section 36 of the agreement
-- of 14.8.2011): whom it covers, the grant by the school's ranking,
-- pro-rating, payment with the August 2021 salary, what it is not part of,
-- the pension contributions, and the owners' indemnity.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in school months of תשפ"א
-- (common.l4: September 2020 = 1, so the August 2021 salary is month 12).

§ `חוזר תשפ"א/9 תגמול בגין הישגי בית הספר`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date, reference number, addressee (the owners of post-primary education), greeting and subject line; the rows below that say something are cited on their own.

-- ¶13-¶15: the general collective agreement of 14.8.2011 between the
-- Centre of Local Government and the three large cities and the Secondary
-- School Teachers' Association, approved by the Treasury's wage
-- commissioner, on עוז לתמורה in upper secondary and on all its teaching
-- employees; this circular publishes the grant for תשפ"א under its section 36.
-- akn:preamble/p13 The agreement of 14.8.2011 this circular implements; it names the source and sets no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 What that agreement covers; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p15 The circular's purpose: the grant for 2020-21 under section 36 of the agreement, encoded in sections 1-2 below.

§§ `1 תחולה`

@desc A teaching employee's school year תשפ"א, as far as the circular asks about it.
DECLARE `achievement year` HAS
    `graded in the teaching-employees grading`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed by a post-primary owner the Ministry supervises` IS A BOOLEAN
    `teaching in upper secondary`                  IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed in the upper grades: 9-12/14 in a four-year school, 10-12/14 in a three- or six-year school
    `school ranking`                               IS A `school grade`
    `upper-secondary position fraction`            IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position held in upper secondary (1 = 100%)
    `months employed at the school`                IS A NUMBER  @desc months of school year 2020-21 employed at the excelling school, unpaid leave and sabbatical excluded
    `months of maternity leave`                    IS A NUMBER  @desc months of maternity leave under the Women's Employment Law, 1954, not counting unpaid leave or absence treated as such after it
    `on full sabbatical or unpaid leave all year`  IS A BOOLEAN

-- Whether under עוז לתמורה or not yet, by the share employed in upper
-- secondary.
@ref akn:art_1
GIVEN a IS AN `achievement year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the circular applies to` a IF
        a's `graded in the teaching-employees grading`
    AND a's `employed by a post-primary owner the Ministry supervises`
    AND a's `teaching in upper secondary`

§§ `2 תגמול עובדי הוראה בגין הישגי בית הספר`

-- (א): the programme runs from תשע"ג under the format and rules of the
-- pedagogical administration's letter of 21.10.2012 (an input: which
-- schools rank where, published by the link of section 3).
DECLARE `school grade` IS ONE OF
    `grade 1, the top 10%`
    `grade 2, the next 10%`
    `grade 3, the next 10% after that`
    `grade 4, the next 10% after that`
    `not ranked for a grant`

@ref akn:art_2__para_a akn:art_3
GIVEN a IS AN `achievement year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the school ranks for a grant` a IF
    NOT (a's `school ranking` EQUALS `not ranked for a grant`)

-- (ב): the grant for a teacher at 100%, updated to May 2021, by the
-- school's grade — one row per printed line. The asterisk: updated by the
-- consumer price index of May 2021 against that of May 2020.
@ref akn:art_2__para_b akn:art_2__para_b/p2 akn:art_2__para_b/p3 akn:art_2__para_b/p4 akn:art_2__para_b/p5 akn:art_2__para_b/p6 akn:art_2__para_b/p7 akn:art_2__para_b/p8 akn:art_2__para_b/p9
DECLARE `grant row` HAS
    `grade of the row`  IS A `school grade`
    `full-time grant`   IS A NUMBER

`the grant table` MEANS
    LIST `grant row` `grade 1, the top 10%`               8443.19,
         `grant row` `grade 2, the next 10%`              6332.39,
         `grant row` `grade 3, the next 10% after that`   4221.6,
         `grant row` `grade 4, the next 10% after that`   3166.19

GIVEN g IS A `school grade`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `full-time grant for` g IS
    sum (map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `full-time grant`)
             (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `grade of the row` EQUALS g) `the grant table`))

-- The grant falls with the grade, and each grade has one row.
`the grant falls with the grade` MEANS
        `full-time grant for` `grade 1, the top 10%` GREATER THAN `full-time grant for` `grade 2, the next 10%`
    AND `full-time grant for` `grade 2, the next 10%` GREATER THAN `full-time grant for` `grade 3, the next 10% after that`
    AND `full-time grant for` `grade 3, the next 10% after that` GREATER THAN `full-time grant for` `grade 4, the next 10% after that`
#ASSERT `the grant falls with the grade`
#ASSERT count `the grant table` EQUALS 4

-- (ג): a part-time or part-year teacher (unpaid leave or sabbatical for
-- part of the year included) gets the proportional part, by the upper-
-- secondary position and by the part of תשפ"א employed at the excelling
-- school. "ו/או" is read as applying whichever of the two the case has, so
-- both where both are partial. Maternity leave counts as employed. A full
-- year's sabbatical or unpaid leave gives no grant. (ד): employment above
-- 100% is not counted.
@ref akn:art_2__para_c akn:art_2__para_d
GIVEN a IS AN `achievement year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `share of the year` a IS
    min 12 (a's `months employed at the school` PLUS a's `months of maternity leave`)
    DIVIDED BY 12

@ref akn:art_2__para_c/p2
GIVEN a IS AN `achievement year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `excluded by a full year's sabbatical or unpaid leave` a IF
    a's `on full sabbatical or unpaid leave all year`

@export default The one-time school-achievement grant in shekels for an upper-secondary teaching employee for 2020-21 under circular תשפ"א/9
GIVEN a IS AN `achievement year` @desc the employee's school year
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `achievement grant` a IS
    IF `the circular applies to` a
       AND `the school ranks for a grant` a
       AND NOT `excluded by a full year's sabbatical or unpaid leave` a
    THEN `full-time grant for` (a's `school ranking`)
         TIMES min (a's `upper-secondary position fraction`) 1
         TIMES `share of the year` a
    ELSE 0

DECLARE `grant action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the achievement grant` HAS `grant paid` IS A NUMBER
    `contribute to a pension fund` HAS `employer contribution` IS A NUMBER
                                       `employee deduction` IS A NUMBER

-- (ה): paid with the August 2021 salary; (ז): with pension-fund
-- contributions of 5% from the employer and 5% deducted from the teacher.
@ref akn:art_2__para_e
GIVEN a IS AN `achievement year`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `grant action`
DECIDE `paying the grant with August's salary` a IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the achievement grant` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `achievement grant` a
    WITHIN `month number` August
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/9 2e: the grants are paid with the August 2021 salary"

`employer pension rate on the grant` MEANS 0.05
`employee pension rate on the grant` MEANS 0.05

-- The corpus prints (ז) inside (ו) (art_2__para_f/p2-p3), with the word
-- "הפרשת" out of place: a corpus defect, reported.
@ref akn:art_2__para_f/p2 akn:art_2__para_f/p3
GIVEN a IS AN `achievement year`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `grant action`
DECIDE `pension contributions on the grant` a IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `contribute to a pension fund` `from the employer` `from the teacher`
          PROVIDED `from the employer` AT LEAST `employer pension rate on the grant` TIMES `achievement grant` a
                   AND `from the teacher` EQUALS `employee pension rate on the grant` TIMES `achievement grant` a
    WITHIN `month number` August
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/9 2g: 5% employer and 5% employee pension contributions on the grant"

-- (ו): the grant is not part of the base for the hourly value, severance
-- or percentage supplements, and no study-fund contributions are made.
DECLARE `salary base` IS ONE OF
    `the hourly value`
    `severance pay`
    `percentage supplements`
    `study-fund contributions`
    `pension-fund contributions`

@ref akn:art_2__para_f
GIVEN b IS A `salary base`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the grant counts toward` b IF
    b EQUALS `pension-fund contributions`

-- 4: the owners are indemnified in the payment system, topic 583, in the
-- August 2021 payments transferred at the start of 9/2021.
@ref akn:art_4
`the payment-system topic of the indemnity` MEANS 583

-- akn:conclusions The contact line, signatures and copies list; no rule.

-- Worked examples: the shekel figures are the circular's own.
`a full-time teacher at a grade-2 school` MEANS
    `achievement year` WITH
        `graded in the teaching-employees grading`     IS TRUE
        `employed by a post-primary owner the Ministry supervises` IS TRUE
        `teaching in upper secondary`                  IS TRUE
        `school ranking`                               IS `grade 2, the next 10%`
        `upper-secondary position fraction`            IS 1.2
        `months employed at the school`                IS 12
        `months of maternity leave`                    IS 0
        `on full sabbatical or unpaid leave all year`  IS FALSE

`a half-time teacher at a grade-1 school, three months on maternity leave` MEANS
    `achievement year` WITH
        `graded in the teaching-employees grading`     IS TRUE
        `employed by a post-primary owner the Ministry supervises` IS TRUE
        `teaching in upper secondary`                  IS TRUE
        `school ranking`                               IS `grade 1, the top 10%`
        `upper-secondary position fraction`            IS 0.5
        `months employed at the school`                IS 9
        `months of maternity leave`                    IS 3
        `on full sabbatical or unpaid leave all year`  IS FALSE

#ASSERT `achievement grant` `a full-time teacher at a grade-2 school` EQUALS 6332.39
#ASSERT `achievement grant` `a half-time teacher at a grade-1 school, three months on maternity leave` EQUALS 4221.595
#ASSERT NOT `the grant counts toward` `severance pay`
#ASSERT `the grant counts toward` `pension-fund contributions`

#TRACE `paying the grant with August's salary` `a full-time teacher at a grade-2 school` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the achievement grant` 6332.39 AT 12
#TRACE `pension contributions on the grant` `a full-time teacher at a grade-2 school` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `contribute to a pension fund` 316.6195 316.6195 AT 12
